                "text": "Here are the important reforms we secured in the Working Families Tax Cut Act to put the American people first and ensure their tax dollars aren't paying for illegal aliens to receive government healthcare benefits. Democrats are gutting these protections with their CRAZY AMERICA-LAST bill: \n\n- Ending Medicaid Funding for Most Non-Citizens\n- Ending Enhanced FMAP for Emergency Care to Illegal Immigrants\n- Closing the California Loophole\n- Ending Medicare Funding for Most Non-Citizens\n- Ending Obamacare Funding for Most Non-Citizens\n- Repealing the Obamacare \"Special Rule\" for Immigrants",
